## CQ-PNE-07
@group client
@commands `tools/perf/sp.sh start`, play 10 min with the world map open part of the time, `tools/perf/sp.sh dump`; compare with perf/reports/sp-20261107-171623
@pass Xaero `BiomeColorCalculator.getBiomeColor` share of the render thread well under 8.8%; no jdk.Deoptimization events; recording covers the whole window
@fails cache missing (check SeasonAnswers hits)
