## CQ-PNE-08
@group client
@commands Stand by a wall of signs (plain, glowing, dyed); back away past 24 blocks; come back; look through a spyglass from 40 blocks
@pass text disappears past 24 blocks and returns closer; signs themselves always drawn; full text through the spyglass; no other block entities or entities misplaced after a cut sign (pose stack balanced)
@fails pose not popped (geometry drifts) or SRG target moved
@draft no batch holds this row yet
## CQ-PNE-09
@group client
@commands Nether: walk crimson forest, warped forest, soul sand valley, basalt deltas, wastes; then step into lava, drink a Blindness potion; look into the Nether through an Immersive Portals portal from the overworld
@pass the same deep red fog and sky colour (#3F0905) in every biome, DH far fog the same red; lava and Blindness keep vanilla's fog; the portal view shows red fog
@fails event not reaching vanilla clear colour, or another mod overriding after LOW
